From: sKyissKy <29267720+sKyissKy@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] mt_wifi7: fix HT/VHT/HE/EHT protocol, BA/RRO, sanity bounds, and FSM checks

Harden management frame IE/length/bounds parsing across cmm_sanity,
ap_mgmt_auth, ap_mgmt_assoc, action, twt_core, ba_action, bss_ops,
spectrum, cmm_info_element, and ap_mgmt_sync. Resolve PMF cross-MBSSID
disconnect bypass, premature FT seq1 key install, dangling PMF deauth
TXS pointer, STA-side HE/VHT/HT capability and BW negotiation defects,
permanent 2.4 GHz 40 MHz coexistence lockdown, AP protection sticky
hardware flag, BSS color BPCC lock/offset corruption, BA timeout skip,
64-bit format/kstrtol bugs, and MT7992 HW RRO RCU/BARecEntry[0] issues.

Signed-off-by: sKyissKy <29267720+sKyissKy@users.noreply.github.com>
